# WolkaraForever layer patch 0048 - direct touch: tap, hold, drag and pinch
#
# Why: with the trackpad off, a finger was only ever a left button pressed at once, so
# nothing gave a right click (attack, talk, loot, open), a tap that moved a little became
# a drag, and there was no way to zoom. Now a quick tap is a left click where the finger
# is, a finger held still for 0.45 s is a right click there (with haptics), sliding after
# the hold is a right drag (turns the character), a finger that moves first is a left drag
# (camera), and a second finger makes it a pinch that zooms the camera like a mouse wheel.
# The host view takes several fingers in both modes for that; the direct gesture follows
# its first finger only. A mouse, trackpad or pencil keeps the immediate behaviour.
#
# Applies to: translation/AppKit/AppKit.m.
# Upstream: candidate.
#
